b": -0.057601154624641715, "compression_ratio": 1.6114649681528663, "no_speech_prob": 0.2180972844362259}, {"id": 18, "seek": 5600, "start": 72.0, "end": 75.0, "text": " Vale, \u00bfy dir\u00edas que ha habido un empeoramiento progresivo?", "tokens": [51164, 26415, 11, 3841, 88, 4746, 10025, 631, 324, 3025, 2925, 517, 846, 494, 284, 16971, 447, 45189, 6340, 30, 51314], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.057601154624641715, "compression_ratio": 1.6114649681528663, "no_speech_prob": 0.2180972844362259}, {"id": 19, "seek": 5600, "start": 75.0, "end": 76.0, "text": " Exactamente.", "tokens": [51314, 7199, 3439, 13, 51364], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.057601154624641715, "compression_ratio": 1.6114649681528663, "no_speech_prob": 0.2180972844362259}, {"id": 20, "seek": 5600, "start": 76.0, "end": 79.0, "text": " \u00bfY te acuerdas de si en alg\u00fan momento hubo una leve mejor\u00eda?", "tokens": [51364, 3841, 56, 535, 696, 5486, 27476, 368, 1511, 465, 26300, 9333, 11838, 78, 2002, 33076, 11479, 2686, 30, 51514], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.057601154624641715, "compression_ratio": 1.6114649681528663, "no_speech_prob": 0.2180972844362259}, {"id": 21, "seek": 5600, "start": 79.0, "end": 81.0, "text": " No, lo he dicho, esto va a costa abajo.", "tokens": [51514, 883, 11, 450, 415, 27346, 11, 7433, 2773, 257, 2063, 64, 30613, 13, 51614], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.057601154624641715, "compression_ratio": 1.6114649681528663, "no_speech_prob": 0.2180972844362259}, {"id": 22, "seek": 8100, "start": 82.0, "end": 88.0, "text": " Vale Ignacio, tambi\u00e9n querr\u00eda saber si esta incapacidad de mover la cara te ha pasado en alg\u00fan otro momento, o fue en diciembre la primera vez.", "tokens": [50414, 26415, 24754, 24571, 11, 6407, 7083, 37183, 12489, 1511, 5283, 30399, 326, 4580, 368, 39945, 635, 10962, 535, 324, 24794, 465, 26300, 11921, 9333, 11, 277, 9248, 465, 14285, 49772, 635, 17382, 5715, 13, 50714], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.09336196121416594, "compression_ratio": 1.4593301435406698, "no_speech_prob": 0.18581074476242065}, {"id": 23, "seek": 8100, "start": 96.0, "end": 103.0, "text": " Genial Ignacio, ahora quiero que intentes hacer memoria de estos \u00faltimos meses, entre los dos vamos a intentar recordar otros s\u00edntomas que has podido tener.", "tokens": [51114, 3632, 831, 24754, 24571, 11, 9923, 16811, 631, 8446, 279, 6720, 1334, 8172, 368, 12585, 33013, 23922, 11, 3962, 1750, 4491, 5295, 257, 46596, 2136, 289, 16422, 8600, 580, 7092, 631, 575, 2497, 2925, 11640, 13, 51464], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.09336196121416594, "compression_ratio": 1.4593301435406698, "no_speech_prob": 0.18581074476242065}, {"id": 24, "seek": 10300, "start": 103.0, "end": 106.0, "text": " Uf, no tengo muy buena memoria, no me acordar\u00e9 de mucho.", "tokens": [50364, 624, 69, 11, 572, 13989, 5323, 25710, 1334, 8172, 11, 572, 385, 38077, 36832, 368, 9824, 13, 50514], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.0647588386092075, "compression_ratio": 1.6893203883495145, "no_speech_prob": 0.32711702585220337}, {"id": 25, "seek": 10300, "start": 106.0, "end": 111.0, "text": " No te preocupes, que yo te voy haciendo preguntas y t\u00fa me respondes. \u00bfHas tenido dolor de o\u00eddo?", "tokens": [50514, 883, 535, 23080, 279, 11, 631, 5290, 535, 7552, 20509, 39722, 288, 15056, 385, 4196, 279, 13, 3841, 39, 296, 33104, 42416, 368, 277, 28470, 30, 50764], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.0647588386092075, "compression_ratio": 1.6893203883495145, "no_speech_prob": 0.32711702585220337}, {"id": 26, "seek": 10300, "start": 111.0, "end": 112.0, "text": " No, la verdad que no.", "tokens": [50764, 883, 11, 635, 13692, 631, 572, 13, 50814], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.0647588386092075, "compression_ratio": 1.6893203883495145, "no_speech_prob": 0.32711702585220337}, {"id": 27, "seek": 10300, "start": 112.0, "end": 113.0, "text": " \u00bfY secreciones?", "tokens": [50814, 3841, 56, 907, 13867, 5411, 30, 50864], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.0647588386092075, "compression_ratio": 1.6893203883495145, "no_speech_prob": 0.32711702585220337}, {"id": 28, "seek": 10300, "start": 113.0, "end": 114.0, "text": " Tampoco, nada de eso.", "tokens": [50864, 314, 1215, 11198, 11, 8096, 368, 7287, 13, 50914], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.0647588386092075, "compression_ratio": 1.6893203883495145, "no_speech_prob": 0.32711702585220337}, {"id": 29, "seek": 10300, "start": 114.0, "end": 116.0, "text": " \u00bfYa has notado en alg\u00fan momento dolor detr\u00e1s del o\u00eddo?", "tokens": [50914, 3841, 26795, 575, 406, 1573, 465, 26300, 9333, 42416, 1141, 17168, 1103, 277, 28470, 30, 51014], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.0647588386092075, "compression_ratio": 1.6893203883495145, "no_speech_prob": 0.32711702585220337}, {"id": 30, "seek": 10300, "start": 116.0, "end": 117.0, "text": " Tampoco.", "tokens": [51014, 314, 1215, 11198, 13, 51064], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.0647588386092075, "compression_ratio": 1.6893203883495145, "no_speech_prob": 0.32711702585220337}, {"id": 31, "seek": 10300, "start": 118.0, "end": 121.0, "text": " \u00bfY sensaci\u00f3n de tener el o\u00eddo lleno o taponado?", "tokens": [51114, 3841, 56, 2923, 3482, 368, 11640, 806, 277, 28470, 4849, 5808, 277, 5119, 266, 1573, 30, 51264], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.0647588386092075, "compression_ratio": 1.6893203883495145, "no_speech_prob": 0.32711702585220337}, {"id": 32, "seek": 10300, "start": 121.0, "end": 122.0, "text": " No, no lo recuerdo.", "tokens": [51264, 883, 11, 572, 450, 850, 22412, 13, 51314], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.0647588386092075, "compression_ratio": 1.6893203883495145, "no_speech_prob": 0.32711702585220337}, {"id": 33, "seek": 10300, "start": 122.0, "end": 127.0, "text": " Vale, \u00bfy te acuerdas si has tenido cambios de saliva, tanto disminuci\u00f3n como aumento de saliva?", "tokens": [51314, 26415, 11, 3841, 88, 535, 696, 5486, 27476, 1511, 575, 33104, 18751, 2717, 368, 43540, 11, 10331, 717, 2367, 30813, 2617, 43600, 368, 43540, 30, 51564], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.0647588386092075, "compression_ratio": 1.6893203883495145, "no_speech_prob": 0.32711702585220337}, {"id": 34, "seek": 10300, "start": 127.0, "end": 131.0, "text": " No, tampoco notaba nada, solamente la incapacidad de mover la cara.", "tokens": [51564, 883, 11, 36838, 406, 5509, 8096, 11, 27814, 635, 30399, 326, 4580, 368, 39945, 635, 10962, 13, 51764], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.0647588386092075, "compression_ratio": 1.6893203883495145, "no_speech_prob": 0.32711702585220337}, {"id": 35, "seek": 13100, "start": 131.0, "end": 134.0, "text": " \u00bfY en la \u00faltima temporada qu\u00e9 tal o\u00edes? \u00bfHas notado alg\u00fan empeoramiento?", "tokens": [50364, 3841, 56, 465, 635, 28118, 41983, 8057, 4023, 277, 870, 279, 30, 3841, 39, 296, 406, 1573, 26300, 846, 494, 284, 16971, 30, 50514], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.07759325504302979, "compression_ratio": 1.6696696696696696, "no_speech_prob": 0.02605162374675274}, {"id": 36, "seek": 13100, "start": 134.0, "end": 140.0, "text": " Ah\u00ed va, pues ahora que lo dices llevo una temporada oyendo regular, pero llevo m\u00e1s de un a\u00f1o as\u00ed, eso ser\u00e1 por la edad, \u00bfno?", "tokens": [50514, 49924, 2773, 11, 11059, 9923, 631, 450, 274, 1473, 12038, 3080, 2002, 41983, 15376, 3999, 3890, 11, 4768, 12038, 3080, 3573, 368, 517, 15984, 8582, 11, 7287, 16502, 1515, 635, 1257, 345, 11, 3841, 1771, 30, 50814], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.07759325504302979, "compression_ratio": 1.6696696696696696, "no_speech_prob": 0.02605162374675274}, {"id": 37, "seek": 13100, "start": 140.0, "end": 145.0, "text": " Bueno, ahora mismo eso no lo podemos saber, y adem\u00e1s de o\u00edr peor te suena haber o\u00eddo alguna vez un pitido.", "tokens": [50814, 16046, 11, 9923, 12461, 7287, 572, 450, 12234, 12489, 11, 288, 21251, 368, 277, 31338, 520, 284, 535, 459, 4118, 15811, 277, 28470, 20651, 5715, 517, 10147, 2925, 13, 51064], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.07759325504302979, "compression_ratio": 1.6696696696696696, "no_speech_prob": 0.02605162374675274}, {"id": 38, "seek": 13100, "start": 145.0, "end": 150.0, "text": " S\u00ed, a veces oigo un silbido que parece que viene de fuera, incluso cuando no estoy escuchando nada.", "tokens": [51064, 12375, 11, 257, 17054, 277, 7483, 517, 3425, 65, 2925, 631, 14120, 631, 19561, 368, 24818, 11, 24018, 7767, 572, 15796, 22483, 1806, 8096, 13, 51314], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.07759325504302979, "compression_ratio": 1.6696696696696696, "no_speech_prob": 0.02605162374675274}, {"id": 39, "seek": 13100, "start": 150.0, "end": 156.0, "text": " Por ejemplo, me ha pasado alguna vez estando en la cama a la noche, ah\u00ed s\u00ed que noto el pitido, incluso cuando est\u00e1 todo en silencio.", "tokens": [51314, 5269, 13358, 11, 385, 324, 24794, 20651, 5715, 871, 1806, 465, 635, 50197, 257, 635, 29735, 11, 12571, 8600, 631, 406, 78, 806, 10147, 2925, 11, 24018, 7767, 3192, 5149, 465, 3425, 268, 8529, 13, 51614], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.07759325504302979, "compression_ratio": 1.6696696696696696, "no_speech_prob": 0.02605162374675274}, {"id": 40, "seek": 15600, "start": 156.0, "end": 162.0, "text": " Vale, vamos muy bien. M\u00e1s all\u00e1 de lo o\u00eddo y la audici\u00f3n, \u00bfhas tenido alg\u00fan s\u00edntoma m\u00e1s general, fiebre o malestar, por ejemplo?", "tokens": [50364, 26415, 11, 5295, 5323, 3610, 13, 376, 2490, 30642, 368, 450, 277, 28470, 288, 635, 2379, 15534, 11, 3841, 12438, 33104, 26300, 8600, 580, 6440, 3573, 2674, 11, 283, 414, 2672, 277, 2806, 39791, 11, 1515, 13358, 30, 50664], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.07220912236039356, "compression_ratio": 1.6317135549872124, "no_speech_prob": 0.039336223155260086}, {"id": 41, "seek": 15600, "start": 162.0, "end": 166.0, "text": " Ya lo siento, doctora, le estoy diciendo que no a todo, pero ciertamente no me encuentro mal.", "tokens": [50664, 6080, 450, 40340, 11, 4631, 64, 11, 476, 15796, 42797, 631, 572, 257, 5149, 11, 4768, 49252, 3439, 572, 385, 23708, 340, 2806, 13, 50864], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.07220912236039356, "compression_ratio": 1.6317135549872124, "no_speech_prob": 0.039336223155260086}, {"id": 42, "seek": 15600, "start": 166.0, "end": 169.0, "text": " No te preocupes, me alegro de que no te hayas encontrado mal estos meses.", "tokens": [50864, 883, 535, 23080, 279, 11, 385, 44491, 340, 368, 631, 572, 535, 4842, 296, 10176, 14974, 2806, 12585, 23922, 13, 51014], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.07220912236039356, "compression_ratio": 1.6317135549872124, "no_speech_prob": 0.039336223155260086}, {"id": 43, "seek": 15600, "start": 169.0, "end": 176.0, "text": " \u00bfHas notado algo raro como debilidad, perdida de fuerza o cambios en la sensibilidad, o bueno, cualquier cosa que t\u00fa veas fuera el habitual?", "tokens": [51014, 3841, 39, 296, 406, 1573, 8655, 367, 9708, 2617, 3001, 388, 4580, 11, 12611, 2887, 368, 39730, 277, 18751, 2717, 465, 635, 2923, 33989, 11, 277, 11974, 11, 21004, 10163, 631, 15056, 1241, 296, 24818, 806, 46883, 30, 51364], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.07220912236039356, "compression_ratio": 1.6317135549872124, "no_speech_prob": 0.039336223155260086}, {"id": 44, "seek": 15600, "start": 176.0, "end": 180.0, "text": " Lo \u00fanico que se me ocurre es que llevo una temporada con sensaci\u00f3n de desequilibrio.", "tokens": [51364, 6130, 26113, 631, 369, 385, 26430, 265, 785, 631, 12038, 3080, 2002, 41983, 416, 2923, 3482, 368, 730, 12816, 12722, 6584, 13, 51564], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.07220912236039356, "compression_ratio": 1.6317135549872124, "no_speech_prob": 0.039336223155260086}, {"id": 45, "seek": 15600, "start": 180.0, "end": 182.0, "text": " Puede ser que est\u00e1s experimentando v\u00e9rtigo.", "tokens": [51564, 13605, 4858, 816, 631, 24389, 5120, 1806, 371, 33672, 7483, 13, 51664], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.07220912236039356, "compression_ratio": 1.6317135549872124, "no_speech_prob": 0.039336223155260086}, {"id": 46, "seek": 15600, "start": 182.0, "end": 185.0, "text": " No, nunca he tenido v\u00e9rtigo, las alturas no me dan miedo.", "tokens": [51664, 883, 11, 13768, 415, 33104, 371, 33672, 7483, 11, 2439, 4955, 12907, 572, 385, 3277, 40383, 13, 51814], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.07220912236039356, "compression_ratio": 1.6317135549872124, "no_speech_prob": 0.039336223155260086}, {"id": 47, "seek": 18500, "start": 185.0, "end": 189.0, "text": " Bueno, s\u00ed, pero me refiero m\u00e1s bien a una sensaci\u00f3n de mareo o andar inseguro.", "tokens": [50364, 16046, 11, 8600, 11, 4768, 385, 1895, 12030, 3573, 3610, 257, 2002, 2923, 3482, 368, 31471, 78, 277, 50009, 33874, 2794, 340, 13, 50564], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.08851458900853207, "compression_ratio": 1.683116883116883, "no_speech_prob": 0.008420858532190323}, {"id": 48, "seek": 18500, "start": 189.0, "end": 193.0, "text": " S\u00ed, a eso me refiero cuando es equilibrio, andar con esa sensaci\u00f3n de que me voy a caer. \u00bfTiene sentido?", "tokens": [50564, 12375, 11, 257, 7287, 385, 1895, 12030, 7767, 785, 14204, 6584, 11, 50009, 416, 11342, 2923, 3482, 368, 631, 385, 7552, 257, 1335, 260, 13, 3841, 51, 10174, 19850, 30, 50764], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.08851458900853207, "compression_ratio": 1.683116883116883, "no_speech_prob": 0.008420858532190323}, {"id": 49, "seek": 18500, "start": 193.0, "end": 196.0, "text": " S\u00ed, tiene mucho sentido, vamos genial, Ignacio.", "tokens": [50764, 12375, 11, 7066, 9824, 19850, 11, 5295, 48228, 11, 24754, 24571, 13, 50914], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.08851458900853207, "compression_ratio": 1.683116883116883, "no_speech_prob": 0.008420858532190323}, {"id": 50, "seek": 18500, "start": 196.0, "end": 199.0, "text": " Ahora quiero que pienses en diciembre, que es cuando te empezaron los s\u00edntomas.", "tokens": [50914, 18840, 16811, 631, 3895, 9085, 465, 14285, 49772, 11, 631, 785, 7767, 535, 18730, 6372, 1750, 8600, 580, 7092, 13, 51064], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.08851458900853207, "compression_ratio": 1.683116883116883, "no_speech_prob": 0.008420858532190323}, {"id": 51, "seek": 18500, "start": 199.0, "end": 203.0, "text": " Y querr\u00eda saber si crees que hay algo que ha podido desencadenar esta par\u00e1lisis.", "tokens": [51064, 398, 7083, 37183, 12489, 1511, 1197, 279, 631, 4842, 8655, 631, 324, 2497, 2925, 18291, 66, 14771, 289, 5283, 971, 11447, 28436, 13, 51264], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.08851458900853207, "compression_ratio": 1.683116883116883, "no_speech_prob": 0.008420858532190323}, {"id": 52, "seek": 18500, "start": 203.0, "end": 205.0, "text": " No entiendo muy bien a qu\u00e9 te refieres.", "tokens": [51264, 883, 948, 7304, 5323, 3610, 257, 8057, 535, 1895, 811, 279, 13, 51364], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.08851458900853207, "compression_ratio": 1.683116883116883, "no_speech_prob": 0.008420858532190323}, {"id": 53, "seek": 18500, "start": 205.0, "end": 209.0, "text": " No te preocupes, que te voy preguntando yo. \u00bfEstuviste, por ejemplo, estresado estos meses?", "tokens": [51364, 883, 535, 23080, 279, 11, 631, 535, 7552, 19860, 1806, 5290, 13, 3841, 29545, 9350, 8375, 11, 1515, 13358, 11, 871, 495, 1573, 12585, 23922, 30, 51564], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.08851458900853207, "compression_ratio": 1.683116883116883, "no_speech_prob": 0.008420858532190323}, {"id": 54, "seek": 18500, "start": 209.0, "end": 214.0, "text": " Nada m\u00e1s de lo normal, todos estamos un poco estresados al preparar toda la Navidad, pero nada extraordinario.", "tokens": [51564, 40992, 3573, 368, 450, 2710, 11, 6321, 10382, 517, 10639, 871, 495, 4181, 419, 8231, 289, 11687, 635, 9219, 4580, 11, 4768, 8096, 27396, 4912, 13, 51814], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.08851458900853207, "compression_ratio": 1.683116883116883, "no_speech_prob": 0.008420858532190323}, {"id": 55, "seek": 21400, "start": 214.0, "end": 217.0, "text": " \u00bfY te acuerdas de si estuviste expuesto a mucho fr\u00edo en esa \u00e9poca?", "tokens": [50364, 3841, 56, 535, 696, 5486, 27476, 368, 1511, 49777, 8375, 1278, 22057, 257, 9824, 431, 20492, 465, 11342, 25024, 30, 50514], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.08818185806274415, "compression_ratio": 1.6529968454258674, "no_speech_prob": 0.01760689727962017}, {"id": 56, "seek": 21400, "start": 217.0, "end": 220.0, "text": " Hombre, pues fr\u00edo s\u00ed, pero no m\u00e1s de lo habitual.", "tokens": [50514, 20903, 2672, 11, 11059, 431, 20492, 8600, 11, 4768, 572, 3573, 368, 450, 46883, 13, 50664], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.08818185806274415, "compression_ratio": 1.6529968454258674, "no_speech_prob": 0.01760689727962017}, {"id": 57, "seek": 21400, "start": 220.0, "end": 225.0, "text": " Me gusta salir a la calle incluso cuando hace fr\u00edo, pero solo es bien protegido e intento no estar mucho tiempo fuera en el fr\u00edo.", "tokens": [50664, 1923, 20576, 31514, 257, 635, 45092, 24018, 7767, 10032, 431, 20492, 11, 4768, 6944, 785, 3610, 49157, 2925, 308, 8446, 78, 572, 8755, 9824, 11772, 24818, 465, 806, 431, 20492, 13, 50914], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.08818185806274415, "compression_ratio": 1.6529968454258674, "no_speech_prob": 0.01760689727962017}, {"id": 58, "seek": 21400, "start": 225.0, "end": 229.0, "text": " Vale, \u00bfy tuviste alguna operaci\u00f3n o quiz\u00e1s alg\u00fan golpe en la cabeza?", "tokens": [50914, 26415, 11, 3841, 88, 38177, 8375, 20651, 2208, 3482, 277, 15450, 2490, 26300, 42032, 465, 635, 34615, 30, 51114], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.08818185806274415, "compression_ratio": 1.6529968454258674, "no_speech_prob": 0.01760689727962017}, {"id": 59, "seek": 21400, "start": 231.0, "end": 236.0, "text": " No creo que sea importante, pero en noviembre me ca\u00ed y me dio un golpe bastante fuerte en la rodilla.", "tokens": [51214, 883, 14336, 631, 4158, 9416, 11, 4768, 465, 572, 12702, 20014, 385, 1335, 870, 288, 385, 31965, 517, 42032, 14651, 37129, 465, 635, 8685, 5291, 13, 51464], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.08818185806274415, "compression_ratio": 1.6529968454258674, "no_speech_prob": 0.01760689727962017}, {"id": 60, "seek": 21400, "start": 236.0, "end": 238.0, "text": " \u00bfPuede tener algo que ver?", "tokens": [51464, 3841, 47, 84, 4858, 11640, 8655, 631, 1306, 30, 51564], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.08818185806274415, "compression_ratio": 1.6529968454258674, "no_speech_prob": 0.01760689727962017}, {"id": 61, "seek": 21400, "start": 240.0, "end": 243.0, "text": " No lo puedo asegurar por ahora, pero no creo que tenga relaci\u00f3n.", "tokens": [51664, 883, 450, 21612, 38174, 28586, 1515, 9923, 11, 4768, 572, 14336, 631, 36031, 37247, 13, 51814], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.08818185806274415, "compression_ratio": 1.6529968454258674, "no_speech_prob": 0.01760689727962017}, {"id": 62, "seek": 24300, "start": 243.0, "end": 247.0, "text": " Bueno, ya lo \u00faltimo antes de pasar a la exploraci\u00f3n. Vamos a hablar un poco de tus antecedentes.", "tokens": [50364, 16046, 11, 2478, 450, 21013, 11014, 368, 25344, 257, 635, 24765, 3482, 13, 10894, 257, 21014, 517, 10639, 368, 20647, 23411, 1232, 9240, 13, 50564], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.08424320836221018, "compression_ratio": 1.5331230283911672, "no_speech_prob": 0.013946061953902245}, {"id": 63, "seek": 24300, "start": 247.0, "end": 249.0, "text": " Cu\u00e9ntame, \u00bftienes alguna alergia?", "tokens": [50564, 13205, 37239, 529, 11, 3841, 83, 1053, 279, 20651, 419, 17025, 654, 30, 50664], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.08424320836221018, "compression_ratio": 1.5331230283911672, "no_speech_prob": 0.013946061953902245}, {"id": 64, "seek": 24300, "start": 249.0, "end": 250.0, "text": " S\u00ed, a la penicilina.", "tokens": [50664, 12375, 11, 257, 635, 3435, 299, 388, 1426, 13, 50714], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.08424320836221018, "compression_ratio": 1.5331230283911672, "no_speech_prob": 0.013946061953902245}, {"id": 65, "seek": 24300, "start": 250.0, "end": 252.0, "text": " \u00bfY tienes alguna otra enfermedad?", "tokens": [50714, 3841, 56, 20716, 20651, 13623, 42695, 345, 30, 50814], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.08424320836221018, "compression_ratio": 1.5331230283911672, "no_speech_prob": 0.013946061953902245}, {"id": 66, "seek": 24300, "start": 252.0, "end": 253.0, "text": " Soy diab\u00e9tico.", "tokens": [50814, 24758, 33227, 39958, 13, 50864], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.08424320836221018, "compression_ratio": 1.5331230283911672, "no_speech_prob": 0.013946061953902245}, {"id": 67, "seek": 24300, "start": 253.0, "end": 256.0, "text": " Vale, esto lo voy a apuntar. \u00bfQu\u00e9 medicamentos sueles tomar?", "tokens": [50864, 26415, 11, 7433, 450, 7552, 257, 1882, 2760, 289, 13, 3841, 15137, 4355, 28775, 459, 6972, 22048, 30, 51014], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.08424320836221018, "compression_ratio": 1.5331230283911672, "no_speech_prob": 0.013946061953902245}, {"id": 68, "seek": 24300, "start": 256.0, "end": 258.0, "text": " Tomo algo que empieza por MET.", "tokens": [51014, 5041, 78, 8655, 631, 44577, 1515, 376, 4850, 13, 51114], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.08424320836221018, "compression_ratio": 1.5331230283911672, "no_speech_prob": 0.013946061953902245}, {"id": 69, "seek": 24300, "start": 258.0, "end": 259.0, "text": " \u00bfMetformina quiz\u00e1s?", "tokens": [51114, 3841, 44, 302, 837, 1426, 15450, 2490, 30, 51164], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.08424320836221018, "compression_ratio": 1.5331230283911672, "no_speech_prob": 0.013946061953902245}, {"id": 70, "seek": 24300, "start": 259.0, "end": 262.0, "text": " S\u00ed, eso es, siempre se me olvida. Menudo nombre m\u00e1s raro.", "tokens": [51164, 12375, 11, 7287, 785, 11, 12758, 369, 385, 2545, 32500, 13, 6685, 6207, 13000, 3573, 367, 9708, 13, 51314], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.08424320836221018, "compression_ratio": 1.5331230283911672, "no_speech_prob": 0.013946061953902245}, {"id": 71, "seek": 24300, "start": 262.0, "end": 266.0, "text": " Bueno Ignacio, gracias por responder a todo. Por favor pasa la camilla que comenzamos la exploraci\u00f3n.", "tokens": [51314, 16046, 24754, 24571, 11, 16611, 1515, 36416, 257, 5149, 13, 5269, 2294, 20260, 635, 1945, 5291, 631, 29564, 2151, 635, 24765, 3482, 13, 51514], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.08424320836221018, "compression_ratio": 1.5331230283911672, "no_speech_prob": 0.013946061953902245}], "language": "es"}